   "issue": "`hL : \u2200 v, \u2016L v\u2016 = \u2016v\u2016` asks for more than the proof uses. The proof ends with `eLpNorm_mono_ae` against the planar reflection, which only needs `\u2016twistedReflection L f z\u2016 \u2264 \u2016planarReflection \u2026 z\u2016` pointwise. Below the axis that reduces to `\u2016L (f (conj z))\u2016 \u2264 \u2016f (conj z)\u2016`. The PR's Q3 counterexample (`L = 3 \u2022 id`) only rules out expanding maps, not contractions.",
